{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>葵涌發生車禍。今日（6月1日）下午2時50分，一輛巴士駛至石蔭路116號對開時，意外撞倒一名單車漢。騎手疑被巴士輾過再捲入車底被困，其後由消防及救護員救出，但已陷昏迷，被送往仁濟醫院搶救。警方現正調查車禍起因。</p><figure><img alt=\"葵涌石蔭路一輛巴士撞倒騎單車男子，傷者被捲入車底，昏迷送院搶救。(林振華攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260601/1138143379029233664901258.jpeg/ho8bTAZXy9NLVpJODdmGS_afkFIVs8emLGKKgjpiioI\"/><figcaption>葵涌石蔭路一輛巴士撞倒騎單車男子，傷者被捲入車底，昏迷送院搶救。(林振華攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"巴士車頭擋風玻璃碎裂。(林振華攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260601/1138143387959300096759834.jpeg/RZrYxqwHk0GSAQNI_rVByf1OD_Ry43NFNxBYKiEQWCo\"/><figcaption>巴士車頭擋風玻璃碎裂。(林振華攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"葵涌石蔭路一輛巴士撞倒騎單車漢，傷者被捲入車底，昏迷送院搶救。(林振華攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260601/1138143381982154752085471.jpeg/kVVNd-hlzKgNIU6oEnkRE4g9g5WMLAIDO7rJSC26yUg\"/><figcaption>葵涌石蔭路一輛巴士撞倒騎單車漢，傷者被捲入車底，昏迷送院搶救。(林振華攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"消防及救護在場施援。（街坊提供）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260601/1138144308637995008630851.png/tjJIt87Y6Me_dJ-Zh4N6e5IJLbJwx-B6ikL_6opC_-o\"/><figcaption>消防及救護在場施援。（街坊提供）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"現場遺下一灘血跡。(林振華攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260601/1138143385098653696731986.jpeg/uoXEbkZJvvDuTHaTtiWI40IYHk15ajMHUNepEEbXqRA\"/><figcaption>現場遺下一灘血跡。(林振華攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"涉事單車翻側。（林振華攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260601/1138143959449604096062517.jpeg/WGmIA3MHAw_UlulPgclqbeC96dE95urpJgoZXTAKGV0\"/><figcaption>涉事單車翻側。（林振華攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"現場遺下一對鞋。（林振華攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260601/1138143962146672640358601.jpeg/GnH4p4NhwFaupchc3RXyy8Hcypl_sWw9OjCMGywwjBs\"/><figcaption>現場遺下一對鞋。（林振華攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"交通警在場調查事件。（林振華攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260601/1138143964965376000324097.jpeg/pnBo-HrNPQWy08uxUl5EKk2AXFa-kLrUkVM3bIdTN2w\"/><figcaption>交通警在場調查事件。（林振華攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"大批消防在場施援。(FB我們都是石籬邨長大的/Loveball Lai）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260601/1138137808645394432091275.png/nkStERm598b-5vdaqB9MfPrnPRY-DdnqoDVIe6A1SHs\"/><figcaption>大批消防在場施援。(FB我們都是石籬邨長大的/Loveball Lai）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-06-01T07:58:36.768154+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":316,"images":9,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none"}}